      "id": 8372,
      "message": "To the people of Israel: I stand with you in grief, remembrance and solidarity on the third anniversary of October 7. We will never forget those murdered or the suffering of their families and the survivors.\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003eThe Islamic Republic that armed and supported Hamas is the same regime that keeps Iranians in chains. When Iran is free, we will hold all those involved in these crimes accountable. Both our peoples deserve freedom and security.\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003eThe bond between Iranians and Jews stretches back 2,500 years to Cyrus the Great. A free Iran will be a friend and partner to Israel. Lasting peace and stability for both our peoples will only come with the fall of the Islamic Republic.\u003cbr/\u003e\u003cbr/\u003eReza Pahlavi",
